prompts[7]{uid,prompt,selector,tag,text}:
  "1",x,"div#q1 > ul > li:nth-of-type(3)",li,"C: any Vektron in good condition, if the price difference is large"
  "3","5000",div#q2 > div,div,"My recommendation: give one number that you will not go over. The worker then also reports deals slightly above it, marked as such."
  "4",i can use both some prt of the remaining budget or my employer bike lease program,"div#q3 > ul > li:nth-of-type(1)",li,"A: your employer (mobility budget or bike lease)"
  "5",yes i can go by train in the netherland its a foldable,"div#q4 > ul > li:nth-of-type(2)",li,"B: Belgium and the Netherlands"
  "6",agree,div#q5 > div,div,"My recommendation: under 3,000 km, battery tested at 85% or more, invoice present. Private seller is fine if you can test-ride it and a dealer reads the motor log."
  "7",asap but one month is the max,div#q6 > div,div,"My recommendation: give a target date. The worker then sets up saved searches and checks again until that date."
  "8",we are happy with no accesories we can add them later,div#q7 > div,div,"My recommendation: list only what is needed from day one. The worker counts it in the all-in price of each option."
