ation: C. Tell me the two employers' lease providers if you know the\"\n      uid=32 b \"My recommendation: C.\"\n  uid=33 div \"Q4 - How far can you travel to buy second-hand? A: Belgium only B: Belgium and t\"\n    uid=34 h2 \"Q4 - How far can you travel to buy second-hand?\"\n    uid=35 ul \"A: Belgium only B: Belgium and the Netherlands C: also Germany and France, or sh\"\n      uid=36 li \"A: Belgium only\"\n      uid=5 li \"B: Belgium and the Netherlands\"\n      uid=37 li \"C: also Germany and France, or shipped\"\n    uid=38 div \"My recommendation: B. The Netherlands has the largest used e-bike market nearby \"\n      uid=39 b \"My recommendation: B.\"\n  uid=40 div \"Q5 - What condition is the minimum? Maximum kilometres on the motor Battery heal\"\n    uid=41 h2 \"Q5 - What condition is the minimum?\"\n    uid=42 ul \"Maximum kilometres on the motor Battery health shown by a dealer test Original i\"\n      uid=43 li \"Maximum kilometres on the motor\"\n      uid=44 li \"Battery health shown by a dealer test\"\n      uid=45 li \"Original invoice (needed for theft insurance and warranty transfer)\"\n      uid=46 li \"Bought from a dealer with warranty, or private seller is fine\"\n    uid=6 div \"My recommendation: under 3,000 km, battery tested at 85% or more, invoice presen\"\n      uid=47 b \"My recommendation:\"\n  uid=48 div \"Q6 - When does the rider need the bike? Waiting longer gives more second-hand of\"\n    uid=49 h2 \"Q6 - When does the rider need the bike?\"\n    uid=50 p \"Waiting longer gives more second-hand offers to compare. Leasing a new one is fa\"\n    uid=7 div \"My recommendation: give a target date. The worker then sets up saved searches an\"\n      uid=51 b \"My recommendation:\"\n  uid=52 div \"Q7 - What else must come with it, or fit the rider? The Vektron is one frame siz\"\n    uid=53 h2 \"Q7 - What else must come with it, or fit the rider?\"\n    uid=54 p \"The Vektron is one frame size for most adult heights. Accessories change the rea\"\n    uid=55 ul \"Rider height (only the number, for the fit check) Needed accessories: rack, chil\"\n      uid=56 li \"Rider height (only the number, for the fit check)\"\n      uid=57 li \"Needed accessories: rack, child seat, lock, bags, second battery\"\n    uid=8 div \"My recommendation: list only what is needed from day one. The worker counts it i\"\n      uid=58 b \"My recommendation:\"\n  uid=59 script"
